span>you want to see the city.</span>"},{"id":8887,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>you want to travel fast.</span>"},{"id":8888,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>you want to travel cheap.</span>"}]},{"id":5610,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The underground is the best option if ...</div>","choices":[{"id":8892,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>you want to travel fast.</span>"},{"id":8893,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>you want to be relaxed.</span>"},{"id":8894,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>you need the cheapest option.</span>"}]},{"id":5611,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>There are lifts ...</div>","choices":[{"id":8895,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>in all underground stations.</span>"},{"id":8896,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>in some underground stations.</span>"},{"id":8897,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>and they are faster than the stairs at busy times.</span>"}]},{"id":5612,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>In the underground, the message 'Mind the gap' means that ...</div>","choices":[{"id":8898,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>you might fall into a hole.</span>"},{"id":8899,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>you must keep a distance from other passengers.</span>"},{"id":8900,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>you might be hit by a running train. </span>"}]}]}]}